# CQ-06 in SAREF Core v4.1.1 -- PARTIAL.
# Controllability is expressible: an Actuator with a Function and Commands.
# The other two constraints are not. SAREF Core has no siting term (node N)
# and no response-time property, so the query below can only return
# controllable devices, unfiltered by location or by T milliseconds.
PREFIX saref: <https://saref.etsi.org/core/>
SELECT ?asset WHERE {
  ?asset a saref:Actuator ;
         saref:hasFunction ?function .
  ?function saref:hasCommand ?command .
}
ORDER BY ?asset
